WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

00:01.698 --> 00:03.433 align:center line:81%
My dear brothers and sisters,

00:03.834 --> 00:09.039 align:center line:79%
lately I’ve been reflecting on three
powerful truths from the Restoration.

00:09.840 --> 00:12.342 align:center line:79%
These truths have profoundly
blessed my life.

00:13.076 --> 00:16.880 align:center line:79%
Today, I would like to share
with you how these truths have guided me

00:16.880 --> 00:21.718 align:center line:79%
on my journey toward a sure witness
of the gospel of Jesus Christ.

00:22.219 --> 00:25.589 align:center line:79%
Number 1—God is our loving
Heavenly Father.

00:25.989 --> 00:28.325 align:center line:81%
He is omniscient and omnipotent.

00:28.625 --> 00:32.563 align:center line:79%
Through the Light of Christ
and the ministration of the Holy Ghost,

00:32.696 --> 00:35.165 align:center line:81%
His influence is everywhere.

00:35.699 --> 00:38.735 align:center line:81%
It is in his nature to bless us.

00:39.603 --> 00:43.340 align:center line:79%
He sees our past,
present, and eternal destiny.

00:43.774 --> 00:46.009 align:center line:81%
Nothing can be hidden from Him.

00:46.743 --> 00:51.815 align:center line:79%
President Russell M. Nelson’s invitation
to “think celestial”

00:51.848 --> 00:56.820 align:center line:79%
encourages us to emulate
our Heavenly Father's vision and nature.

00:57.487 --> 01:03.026 align:center line:79%
Because of His divine attributes, our
Heavenly Father gives us every good gift,

01:03.560 --> 01:07.998 align:center line:79%
each with His eternal
perspective and vision in mind.

01:08.699 --> 01:14.037 align:center line:79%
Number two—agency is the gift
to choose and act for ourselves.

01:14.571 --> 01:18.275 align:center line:79%
It is also the responsibility
to choose well.

01:19.076 --> 01:22.779 align:center line:79%
Jesus Christ paid the ultimate price
for that privilege

01:22.779 --> 01:24.548 align:center line:81%
with His precious blood.

01:25.415 --> 01:29.319 align:center line:79%
Sometimes we might believe that agency
means doing whatever we want.

01:29.853 --> 01:35.525 align:center line:79%
But the fact that the price was paid
means agency is a sacred gift.

01:36.526 --> 01:39.997 align:center line:79%
We are agents, and agents are
responsible for something.

01:40.631 --> 01:45.135 align:center line:79%
In this case, we're responsible
for the choices we make based

01:45.135 --> 01:49.506 align:center line:79%
on the knowledge we have and
the gifts we are given.

01:50.407 --> 01:55.579 align:center line:79%
We cannot make a choice without being
responsible for the consequences.

01:56.647 --> 01:58.281 align:center line:81%
Why do we have agency?

01:58.882 --> 02:03.754 align:center line:79%
To choose good. To choose Christ,
to choose eternal life—

02:03.787 --> 02:05.055 align:center line:81%
again and again.

02:06.390 --> 02:10.761 align:center line:79%
Number three—our testimony comes
through the power of the Holy Ghost.

02:11.461 --> 02:14.564 align:center line:79%
A witness from the Holy Ghost
is greater than sight.

02:15.165 --> 02:18.535 align:center line:79%
He is the preeminent
witness of the Father and the Son.

02:19.236 --> 02:20.537 align:center line:81%
President Nelson taught:

02:20.537 --> 02:22.706 align:center line:79%
“In the coming days,
it will not be possible

02:22.706 --> 02:26.677 align:center line:79%
to survive spiritually without
the guiding, directing, comforting,

02:26.677 --> 02:29.046 align:center line:81%
and constant influence of the Holy Ghost.”

02:29.713 --> 02:30.881 align:center line:81%
Brothers and sisters,

02:30.881 --> 02:33.684 align:center line:79%
this is why we each need the power
of the Holy Ghost

02:33.684 --> 02:38.088 align:center line:79%
today. A testimony through the Holy Ghost
can come in many ways.

02:38.588 --> 02:40.323 align:center line:81%
Like a light bulb in a dark room,

02:40.323 --> 02:42.726 align:center line:81%
it can come on dramatically and suddenly.

02:43.393 --> 02:45.429 align:center line:81%
It can come like the sunrise,

02:45.429 --> 02:49.766 align:center line:79%
gradually and over time. It
can come like rays of light,

02:49.766 --> 02:52.602 align:center line:79%
intermittent exposure
to pure intelligence.

02:53.203 --> 02:58.475 align:center line:79%
Whatever the way it comes—whatever
the way—it comes through the Holy Ghost.

02:59.976 --> 03:01.912 align:center line:81%
I grew up in beautiful Jamaica;

03:02.412 --> 03:04.214 align:center line:81%
it was fun and wonderful.

03:04.881 --> 03:06.950 align:center line:81%
However, when I started high school,

03:06.950 --> 03:10.921 align:center line:79%
some classmates and friends could not
understand my decision to be a member

03:10.921 --> 03:12.789 align:center line:81%
of the Church of Jesus Christ.

03:13.490 --> 03:15.492 align:center line:81%
“How could you join that Church?”

03:15.559 --> 03:18.295 align:center line:81%
they would ask. “How could you believe

03:18.295 --> 03:21.031 align:center line:79%
that story?”—referring
to the First Vision.

03:21.865 --> 03:25.669 align:center line:79%
How could you read that book?”
—referring to the Book of Mormon.

03:26.136 --> 03:28.271 align:center line:81%
“Do you really believe all that?”

03:29.306 --> 03:31.541 align:center line:81%
and “Why are you wasting your life away?”

03:32.676 --> 03:38.515 align:center line:79%
It was painful, especially when
it came from people I cared about.

03:38.515 --> 03:45.489 align:center line:79%
But what they did not know was this: I
had an experience with the Holy Ghost.

03:46.423 --> 03:48.892 align:center line:81%
As that testimony filled my heart,

03:49.092 --> 03:53.230 align:center line:79%
it dulled the pain of days
and “for one brief moment,

03:53.230 --> 03:56.333 align:center line:81%
heaven’s view [appeared] before my gaze.”

03:57.567 --> 04:00.904 align:center line:79%
Perhaps you have been asked
some of these questions.

04:01.238 --> 04:04.207 align:center line:79%
Perhaps even now you are
being bombarded as I was.

04:05.475 --> 04:11.548 align:center line:79%
The gift and witness of the Holy
Ghost are available to everyone.

04:12.649 --> 04:15.819 align:center line:79%
Jamaica is to me like
Palmyra was to Joseph Smith.

04:16.219 --> 04:17.954 align:center line:81%
It is my Sacred Grove.

04:18.622 --> 04:22.859 align:center line:79%
I do not know the exact spot where
Joseph knelt to pray in the Sacred Grove,

04:23.193 --> 04:28.665 align:center line:79%
but I know exactly where I was when
my sacred grove became a reality.

04:29.266 --> 04:33.069 align:center line:79%
It happened at Four Grove Road,
Mandeville, Jamaica,

04:33.870 --> 04:37.707 align:center line:81%
in my bathroom, at 6 a.m. on a Wednesday—

04:39.676 --> 04:42.112 align:center line:81%
three years after my baptism.

04:43.280 --> 04:46.550 align:center line:79%
This sacred experience
happened because two weeks earlier

04:46.716 --> 04:51.054 align:center line:79%
and inspired sister missionary invited me
to read the Book of Mormon.

04:51.922 --> 04:55.992 align:center line:79%
Sister Audrey Krauss is attending
this conference today with her family

04:55.992 --> 04:57.828 align:center line:81%
and I forever love her.

04:58.762 --> 05:00.964 align:center line:81%
That experience changed me.

05:02.365 --> 05:09.005 align:center line:79%
Brothers and sisters, a testimony is not
given for temporary use.

05:10.207 --> 05:14.377 align:center line:79%
This gift from our Heavenly Father,
our loving Heavenly Father,

05:14.377 --> 05:19.049 align:center line:79%
is meant to be eternal
because the Giver is eternal.

05:20.283 --> 05:23.320 align:center line:79%
A testimony should not
have an expiration date.

05:23.887 --> 05:28.291 align:center line:79%
It should not weaken or diminish
because something in my life has changed

05:28.291 --> 05:30.293 align:center line:81%
or something in the world has changed.

05:31.428 --> 05:37.467 align:center line:79%
It should get stronger because, like
the servant in the parable of the talents,

05:37.667 --> 05:43.640 align:center line:79%
my personal testimony is a gift
to be multiplied, not buried.

05:44.975 --> 05:47.677 align:center line:79%
Looking back on those difficult
days of testing

05:47.677 --> 05:52.115 align:center line:79%
and persecution that I went
through as a child has helped me to get

05:52.115 --> 05:59.055 align:center line:79%
to the place where I now know for myself.
I not only believe, hope, or trust,

05:59.055 --> 06:02.659 align:center line:79%
even though these are all
significant particles of faith

06:02.659 --> 06:04.427 align:center line:81%
on the pathway to a sure witness.

06:04.961 --> 06:11.568 align:center line:79%
I commend you for making your own way
by asking questions, studying, praying,

06:11.768 --> 06:13.570 align:center line:81%
fasting, and pondering.

06:14.137 --> 06:20.977 align:center line:79%
Please don’t stop. It is worth every
effort to pursue this path to testimony.

06:22.178 --> 06:26.683 align:center line:79%
Who or what will you allow
to take that away?

06:28.585 --> 06:33.256 align:center line:79%
“What greater witness
can you have than from God?”

06:35.725 --> 06:39.095 align:center line:79%
Every son or daughter
of God can gain a deeper,

06:39.095 --> 06:41.965 align:center line:79%
firmer, and surer knowledge
for themselves.

06:42.365 --> 06:46.002 align:center line:79%
Like Joseph Smith, who affirmed
his testimony despite opposition,

06:46.036 --> 06:50.707 align:center line:79%
we can boldly say, “I knew it,
and I knew that God knew it,

06:50.707 --> 06:52.509 align:center line:81%
and I could not deny it,

06:52.542 --> 06:54.444 align:center line:81%
neither dare I do it.”

06:56.079 --> 06:57.914 align:center line:81%
My dear brothers and sisters,

06:58.715 --> 07:03.019 align:center line:79%
let the small seedling of testimony work
in you until it springs up

07:03.019 --> 07:07.223 align:center line:79%
to an everlastingly glorious,
sure knowledge.

07:08.191 --> 07:10.360 align:center line:81%
If you are a baptized member

07:10.660 --> 07:13.063 align:center line:79%
and confirmed member
of The Church of Jesus Christ of

07:13.063 --> 07:17.367 align:center line:79%
Latter-day Saints, but still struggle
with, “I’m not sure if I know.”

07:17.834 --> 07:19.636 align:center line:81%
Please remember this promise

07:19.636 --> 07:25.141 align:center line:79%
in the sacrament prayer: “that they may
always have His Spirit to be with them.”

07:25.775 --> 07:27.143 align:center line:81%
Because of this promise,

07:27.143 --> 07:32.015 align:center line:79%
each of us can pursue the path
to testimony and a sure knowledge.

07:32.983 --> 07:37.921 align:center line:79%
Now here is a grand truth: In whatever
way a testimony is given—

07:38.121 --> 07:42.492 align:center line:79%
whether it is distilled like the sunrise
or comes in a glorious vision—

07:42.492 --> 07:48.264 align:center line:79%
it still requires a choice
to receive this precious gift.

07:49.599 --> 07:54.571 align:center line:79%
Saying “I choose to believe” makes it
easier to receive a witness from God.

07:55.238 --> 07:57.507 align:center line:81%
If we find our testimony weakening,

07:57.774 --> 08:02.212 align:center line:79%
remember that it is the choices
we make that diminish the power

08:02.212 --> 08:05.715 align:center line:79%
of the testimony. But the testimony
has not gone anywhere.

08:05.982 --> 08:08.885 align:center line:79%
We just need to choose
to reconnect with it.

08:09.486 --> 08:14.924 align:center line:79%
Choosing to believe is a wise
and powerful way to use our agency.

08:16.526 --> 08:23.633 align:center line:79%
I cannot see a better way to use my agency
than in defense of my testimony.

08:24.968 --> 08:26.569 align:center line:81%
President Nelson taught:

08:26.836 --> 08:30.006 align:center line:79%
“I plead with you to take charge
of your testimony.

08:30.173 --> 08:32.542 align:center line:81%
Work for it. Own it. Care for it.

08:32.542 --> 08:34.377 align:center line:81%
Nurture it so that it will grow.

08:34.677 --> 08:35.945 align:center line:81%
Feed it truth.”

08:37.013 --> 08:42.752 align:center line:79%
To me, the words “take charge,”
“work,” “care,” “own,”

08:42.786 --> 08:47.690 align:center line:79%
“nurture,” and “feed” sound like
an agent given stewardship

08:47.690 --> 08:51.428 align:center line:81%
for something precious and important.

08:52.929 --> 08:56.066 align:center line:79%
In the early Church,
Parley P. Pratt felt disgruntled

08:56.066 --> 09:00.236 align:center line:79%
with the Prophet Joseph Smith
and chose to criticize him and the Church.

09:00.570 --> 09:03.907 align:center line:79%
“When John Taylor [whom Parley
taught the gospel] came to town,

09:03.907 --> 09:07.343 align:center line:79%
Parley [took] him aside and warned
him not to follow Joseph.”

09:08.078 --> 09:12.248 align:center line:79%
John Taylor said to Parley,
“Before you left Canada,

09:12.782 --> 09:16.786 align:center line:79%
you bore a strong testimony
of Joseph Smith being a prophet of God,

09:16.786 --> 09:19.756 align:center line:79%
... and you said you knew
these things by revelation

09:19.756 --> 09:21.491 align:center line:81%
and the gift of the Holy Ghost. ...

09:21.925 --> 09:27.297 align:center line:79%
I now have that same
testimony that you then rejoiced

09:27.297 --> 09:30.033 align:center line:81%
in. If the work was true six months ago,

09:30.233 --> 09:36.072 align:center line:79%
it is true today. If Joseph Smith was then
a prophet, he is now a prophet.”

09:37.040 --> 09:40.076 align:center line:79%
I testify that Joseph Smith
was a prophet of God,

09:40.276 --> 09:44.347 align:center line:79%
and that the prophetic mantle
he received continues today.

09:45.048 --> 09:47.851 align:center line:81%
Jesus Christ directs this work.

09:48.718 --> 09:52.856 align:center line:79%
I invite you to think about
your past to as sure witness

09:52.856 --> 09:54.991 align:center line:81%
of Jesus Christ and His gospel.

09:55.291 --> 09:57.393 align:center line:81%
Take charge of your testimony,

09:57.427 --> 10:02.432 align:center line:79%
use your agency wisely, and acknowledge
the Giver and His glorious attributes.

10:02.732 --> 10:05.835 align:center line:79%
I bear witness that the
power is within you.

10:06.269 --> 10:09.272 align:center line:81%
No one can choose for you.

10:09.672 --> 10:12.509 align:center line:81%
No one can take this gift away.

10:13.009 --> 10:15.912 align:center line:81%
You can choose to believe.

10:17.046 --> 10:19.716 align:center line:81%
I promise you that as you do this,

10:19.749 --> 10:21.551 align:center line:81%
your testimony will be a “well

10:21.551 --> 10:24.420 align:center line:79%
of living water springing
up unto everlasting life.”

10:24.587 --> 10:26.789 align:center line:81%
It will be an anchor and a motivator,

10:26.789 --> 10:29.993 align:center line:79%
and it will sustain you
through difficult times.

10:30.059 --> 10:34.197 align:center line:79%
It will enable you
to develop spiritual gifts.

10:34.430 --> 10:38.368 align:center line:79%
It will help you in your personal
ministry and service.

10:38.635 --> 10:42.572 align:center line:79%
It will be a weapon against
Satan and your adversaries.

10:42.772 --> 10:45.208 align:center line:81%
Your testimony will be a joy

10:45.341 --> 10:47.810 align:center line:81%
as you see it replicated in your children,

10:47.810 --> 10:51.414 align:center line:79%
grandchildren, and great-
grandchildren, and in those you love

10:51.414 --> 10:54.250 align:center line:81%
and serve. It will be powerful

10:54.417 --> 10:56.986 align:center line:81%
when you share it and use it to testify.

10:57.587 --> 11:00.056 align:center line:81%
If you know, you know.

11:02.025 --> 11:08.631 align:center line:79%
I know that I know. We need more sure
witnesses of Jesus Christ and His gospel.

11:08.965 --> 11:12.135 align:center line:81%
Get there! Seek it! It is urgent!

11:12.368 --> 11:16.272 align:center line:79%
This is the final dispensation
of the fulness of times.

11:16.806 --> 11:19.309 align:center line:81%
Jesus Christ declared this truth:

11:19.342 --> 11:23.880 align:center line:79%
“Heaven and earth shall pass away,
but my words shall not pass away.”

11:24.314 --> 11:25.548 align:center line:81%
Brothers and sisters,

11:25.582 --> 11:29.986 align:center line:79%
a testimony of Jesus Christ was never
meant to be a temporary gift.

11:30.153 --> 11:32.555 align:center line:81%
Nothing about it is temporary.

11:32.722 --> 11:35.625 align:center line:81%
Not the giver, not the gift itself,

11:35.758 --> 11:37.527 align:center line:81%
not the deliverer of the gift,

11:37.560 --> 11:39.362 align:center line:81%
not who the gift is about.

11:40.296 --> 11:44.234 align:center line:79%
May your testimony be described
in this same way.

11:44.867 --> 11:47.870 align:center line:81%
Though “heaven and earth shall pass away,”

11:48.071 --> 11:53.776 align:center line:79%
your testimony and witness of the gospel
of Jesus Christ will not pass away.

11:54.344 --> 12:00.316 align:center line:79%
Now is the time to lay hold
on this precious gift.

12:00.516 --> 12:02.285 align:center line:81%
In the name of Jesus Christ,

12:02.285 --> 12:03.686 align:center line:81%
amen.

